{"version":1,"key":"card:245","content":{"id":245,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以看做是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"StrongSet","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所谓的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Strong","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是集合中的元素保持对对象的引用，例如"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let set = new Set();\nlet key = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nset.add(key);\n\nkey = null;","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"58d05ec3-054e-4448-88e7-609e9752f302","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合中添加了一个对象 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"key","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，随后将对象 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"key","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是集合仍然保持着对对象的引用，这就意味着无法回收此对象(这个对象已经无法访问，按道理应该被回收掉)，可能会造成内存泄漏的问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以相应的提出了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"WeakSet","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所谓的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"WeakSet","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是其中的元素没有保持的对对象的引用，如果对象被设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么该对象就可以被回收"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let weakSet = new WeakSet();\nlet key = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nweakSet.add(key);\n\n// 设置为 null 了，对象可以被作为垃圾回收了\nkey = null;","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0747101c-69fc-4591-ba42-c023047ccade","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"WeakSet","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相似的 API"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph